{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_104_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_104","textTraditional":"一、八年，春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_104_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_104","textTraditional":"二、夏四月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_104_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_104","textTraditional":"三、秋八月戊申，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_104_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_104","textTraditional":"四、冬十月壬午，公子遂會晉趙盾，盟于衡雍。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_104_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_104","textTraditional":"五、乙酉，公子遂會伊雒戎，盟于暴。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_104_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_104","textTraditional":"六、公孫敖如京師，不至復。丙戌，奔莒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_104_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_104","textTraditional":"不至復者何？不至復者，內辭也，不可使往也。不可使往，則其言如京師何？遂公意也。何以不言出？遂在外也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_104_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_104","textTraditional":"七、〈虫衆〉。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_104_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_104","textTraditional":"八、宋人殺其大夫司馬。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_104_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_104","textTraditional":"九、宋司城來奔。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_104_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_104","textTraditional":"司馬者何？司城者何？皆官舉也。曷為皆官舉？宋三世無大夫，三世內娶也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}